{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_title", "source_sha256": "1dea66c4eb2da118b2c8eb3cdd7fffca6a61c64687fbdec102dc942c1eb9739c", "ja": "運命を創る者", "zh": "命运的创造者", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7ec6217d6943bac1f04f60096a12e551cf24dee3879cefd368ee6ad5dae8bc76", "ja": "あずさは恋愛ドラマのオファーを受けるが、\n主演俳優の下心からのものと判明して話は立\nち消えに。俳優の捨て台詞で今までの仕事を\n貶され反発したあずさは、アイドルとしての\n誇りとともに公演のステージに立つ。", "zh": "梓接到了恋爱电视剧的工作邀约，\n但得知是主演演员心怀不轨后，此事便\n不了了之。面对该演员贬低自己至今为止\n工作成果的临走嘲讽，梓心生反抗，\n怀着作为偶像的骄傲登上了公演的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1921e3c4bab7bf7d531939f450770b21cc5630c926271fd508542eb4dac6cc80", "ja": "（そしてドラマの顔合わせの日。あずささんと一緒に、\n本当に茜と育のキャスティングも決まった……）", "zh": "（然后就是电视剧碰面的那天。没想到除了和歌织一起，茜和育的角色也真的定下来了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "ee5595569333a55da39f2a4f930f1caeacaa081658f9d463488a6c9e8e5a12e2", "ja": "主人公が過去に想いを寄せていた儚げ系美少女。\n茜ちゃんにピッタリの配役だね！", "zh": "男主角过去曾倾慕过的、惹人怜爱的美少女。  \n简直是最适合小茜的角色了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "a88fe3b4466f9668410e7b104449c9202946f970b23c327c67c1c2eb75886fd1", "ja": "いやーsoumaくん、爽やかイケメンなだけじゃなくて\n見る目もあるなんて！　まさか茜ちゃん並みの天才か？", "zh": "哎呀，souma君不只是清爽帅哥，眼光也这么好！难道你是和小茜一样的天才吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "5f8247c40b7a2d80a57054fedc2149ab138254367687d86cdd4f1bb4011dcb6b", "ja": "わたしはあずささんの子ども時代の役だから、あずささ\nんみたいにきれいでやさしそうな感じにしなくっちゃ！", "zh": "我演的是梓小姐小时候的角色，所以一定要表现出像梓小姐一样漂亮又温柔的感觉才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "92eb14253df9bceae48bdde1b01b7148434f3720e61273608eb977746525d15a", "ja": "育ちゃんは子供の頃の私より、ずっとしっかりしてる\nもの。私のほうこそいいのかしら……。", "zh": "育比小时候的我可靠多了。反倒是我这样真的没问题吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9f3a0da74c965f327edd1297e077599a021e52f7edf2ea9f0b692bb80b863da1", "ja": "あずささん、公演も控えてる時にすみません。\n先方の事務所から、ぜひクランクインの前に挨拶をと…", "zh": "梓小姐，演出在即还来打扰您，实在抱歉。对方事务所那边说，希望能在开机前先来打个招呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "8ba7db80aaa8a73bb852a638724b4ad4e9bcedf0ffa65fd1fe8cbbc82c2891a1", "ja": "とんでもないです。ご挨拶は早いほうがいいですから。\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "没这回事。问候还是越早越好。\n还请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d7b23b2f1018c093c7cd87613925bf1abe89115bee4e0db2aacfc3afe7034f10", "ja": "（地上波の連ドラは話題性があるし、みんなの知名度も\n一気に上がる。これは成功させないとだな）", "zh": "（地上波连续剧很有话题性，大家的知名度也会一下子提升。这次可得成功才行啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c0c892349b4af30929089444fdeda0cef86bf30fd194dc7972c7b4dca0e5fdbb", "ja": "（そして……）", "zh": "（然后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1009_souma", "source_sha256": "c8a4265399da6a7a2388107e2c46026c79b4e26f69c517f65cd94afe221d4a8e", "ja": "主演のsoumaです。作品の魅力をしっかり伝えられる\nよう尽力しますので、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我是主演souma。为了充分传达作品的魅力，我会全力以赴，还请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1010_souma", "source_sha256": "b25d4de8c1300ec42792839cd9fc4889bc58676fce7595e8c93e8480966a25e3", "ja": "三浦さん、今回は突然すみませんでした。\nじつは以前から素敵な方だなぁと思っていて……。", "zh": "三浦小姐，这次突然来找您，真的很抱歉。\n其实，我以前就觉得您是个很棒的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1011_souma", "source_sha256": "5118f41ccd9ca47b0d068a4d626528a56827d73f021a63748bd6dad2458abd71", "ja": "このお話を頂いた時、相手役には貴女しかいないと\n直感して、僕からお願いしたんです。", "zh": "接到这个故事时，我凭直觉认定，搭档角色非你莫属，  \n所以是我主动提出请求的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "bc6c2e93c3d3c7d456498602e1046755dc13394a379a4b9473a0effa3fa8905f", "ja": "そんな、soumaさんのような方にそう言って\nいただけるなんて、もったいないくらいです。", "zh": "能得到像souma先生这样的人如此评价，真是让我受宠若惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "1136b446b99c0b3dbe85f77ca0089461ef572b2a575d0b2a8f407595c85839e6", "ja": "少しでもご期待に応えられるよう、精いっぱい\n頑張りますね。よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "为了能多少回应您的期待，我会全力以赴\n去努力的。请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1014_souma", "source_sha256": "9a2dfd13ff340105fb09eaba0f0d3d75b34c3ecf09ed7c5cd218ee130215609c", "ja": "三浦さんなら大丈夫ですよ。困った時はいくらでも頼っ\nてください。役と同じように貴女を支えてみせます。", "zh": "三浦小姐，您一定没问题的。遇到困难时，尽管来依靠我。我一定会像支持您的角色那样支持您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "9bab87df086d649f82dd4cdb6f024c2bc982669ae5a8713031fdfb01a07fa07c", "ja": "まぁ、ありがとうございます～。とっても心強いです。\nいざという時は、頼りにさせていただきますね。", "zh": "哎呀，真是太谢谢你了～。有你这句话我就放心多了。\n要是真遇到什么事，就承蒙你多关照啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "e56d67eb7eaf7f3cb8a7d21a99815a890460cf17b1204efe8f00c9ebab553233", "ja": "……ほほう、噂にたがわぬ好青年のようだね。\nおまけにあずさちゃんにゾッコンみたい。", "zh": "……呼呼，看来正如传闻中所说，是个好青年呢。\n而且似乎还对梓神魂颠倒的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "5750827bb9c23883cf3ddf80a9e0d6a10d0a15069f55caee40284d11f3287277", "ja": "こうせいねんって、やさしいってこと？　じゃあ\nもしかして、この人があずささんの『うんめいの人』？", "zh": "好青年就是温柔的意思吗？那……难道这个人就是梓小姐的『命中注定的人』？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1018_p", "source_sha256": "61d55d7a543699a425accc4a2c9ccd6f77714b4d51ef1880350d35be01999e15", "ja": "……こらこら。ふたりとも、仕事中に気を散らさない。", "zh": "……好啦好啦。你们两个，工作的时候别分心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1019_p", "source_sha256": "da68bd88793437dd165a2bf44a9e38d6ea1f53f9287be8bf05017d6e205f04f7", "ja": "（……でも、少なくともあずささんとの相性は、\n悪くなさそう……かな？）", "zh": "（……不过，至少和梓小姐的相性，似乎还不错……吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1020_p", "source_sha256": "1b4507318a63fed6c708846cce6c6aecae2442b308247d722ca2fe6fd41bc6d2", "ja": "（その後の顔合わせでは、茜と育を監督に売り込む話が\n弾み、あずささん達二人は先に席を外していた）", "zh": "（在那之后的见面会上，关于向导演推荐茜和育的话题聊得很投机，あずさ小姐她们两人已经先离席了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1021_p", "source_sha256": "40f7025fecf395d18e54547086752226c5fbb1c77b4f4f41807c02c2049740c4", "ja": "ふう、いいミーティングができた。でもすっかり\nあずささんを待たせてしまったな。えっと……", "zh": "呼，开了个很顺利的会。不过让梓小姐等了这么久。那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "33e7e7958e378793af83e099b79d5be2947269ee53c9f5e68637da3ca957597f", "ja": "あ、あそこにいたよ、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "啊，她在那里，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "927cacc421ae73d2f1918e1d49966dca582d777bf72185864593952312aafe27", "ja": "やっぱりsoumaくんと一緒だね！　……あれ？", "zh": "果然是和souma在一起呢！……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1024_souma", "source_sha256": "476148f5efd47ed1dd83482aa118b678bb379c35edace689437ff55a94862e28", "ja": "……でさ、知ってる店があるんだけど、\nこの後はそこでいいよね。", "zh": "……我知道有一家店，接下来去那里就行吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "f56a60951b9b35558f3fffe42ad2843fed30107fd6594432532557a5030fcec8", "ja": "え？　今日はこれで終わりって聞いていたんですけど…\nそれに公演も近いものですから、早く帰らないと。", "zh": "咦？我听说今天到这里就结束了……而且公演也快到了，得早点回去才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1026_souma", "source_sha256": "880ae60c0e9ba73871048e7ac5befdc15231dfe3ef450312c43d2fc977fe12aa", "ja": "ああ、まずは真面目ってことにしといたほうがギャップ\n出るもんね。そういうのいいから。車出すよ。", "zh": "啊，先让人觉得一本正经一点，才更有反差嘛。\n这种事就免了。我去把车开出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "ca404c8b2b51e42066f6fdc9faa9092a1f5c8c89f48543510abc1929a1fba83a", "ja": "いえ、{$P$}さんに送ってもらう\nことになっていますから、大丈夫です～。", "zh": "不用了，{$P$}先生会送我\n回去的，所以没关系的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1028_souma", "source_sha256": "d55dfda92dd57db63eb8ea4985511ae8106b9fb62579dbe15dc5bc6ac5686437", "ja": "えー、そういうのダルいな。本気で言ってんの？\n何が気に入らないわけ。", "zh": "啊，那种事很麻烦啊。你是认真的吗？\n到底有什么不满意的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "840b96d48d29fa510910585d6cf3d358a6efe7978fa05a51242f20ba3ef67e6a", "ja": "……？　すみません、あの、本気というのは？", "zh": "……？不好意思，请问，认真是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1030_p", "source_sha256": "ca124defffffd04e1156cba09de3f01560c088ceff43002d9107d49a3bb5ff75", "ja": "――これは……、すみません！", "zh": "——这真是……非常抱歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1031_p", "source_sha256": "b7f96db3e0d2c8ca798c4038778130c515ae122c00a11b172eee3c70e55257c2", "ja": "お心遣い痛み入ります。ご意見ご指摘など、続きは\n自分が承りますので、日時をご指定いただけますか。", "zh": "承蒙您的关照，实在感激。关于意见和指正等后续事宜，就由我来负责，您可以指定日期和时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "1dc7f2c467484eb93c542c45980ec9bba9b94937fe14679327e7c4450aa0c932", "ja": "あっ……、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "啊……，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1033_souma", "source_sha256": "86fcc11efe2ee5f9e94a1f77a951d304649839ea3ad5ca0c5b91ab9993c213c6", "ja": "うわ、マジで言ってたんだ？　騙された。あんたらさ、\nああいうカッコであんな売り方ばっかしといて……", "zh": "哇，你们还真是那么说的啊？我被骗了。你们啊，\n总是穿成那样，还老是用那种方式卖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1034_souma", "source_sha256": "58dcbc2c07bcdc0f3cc647903bb1908fac46932b1c05b14ccae11097dff82087", "ja": "遊んでないとは思わないじゃん。紛らわしいこと\nすんなよな。……あー時間無駄にした、他当たるわ。", "zh": "你不会以为我没在玩吗。别做这种让人误会的事啊。……啊，浪费时间了，我去找别人问问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1035_se", "source_sha256": "5eb294583bc6f40ad4e1df90eb85c503fc9ab6b6afb330bcf1c8be5b6f361216", "ja": "タッタッタ……", "zh": "哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1036_p", "source_sha256": "ed36d8fbd954dd5737b0cf6c59c421897731e349dc957a62e5d9dd503305df7f", "ja": "（行ってしまった……あいつ、最初からそういう……\nいや、それよりも）", "zh": "（她走掉了……那家伙，从一开始就是那样……不，比起这个）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1037_p", "source_sha256": "bee098f39330fee51b002a300298e8f4a42b49a093125287c4215993b9e3159d", "ja": "あずささん、大丈夫ですか？\nすみません、ふたりにしてしまって……。", "zh": "梓小姐，你没事吧？\n对不起，把你们两个人单独留下了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1038_p", "source_sha256": "2690d0ea922847f997f9622e20d583342644e66e0852a59d3ad2a5895b3c198c", "ja": "育も、茜もごめんな。びっくりしたよな。", "zh": "育、茜，对不起啊。你们也吓到了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1039_030iku", "source_sha256": "ed67441133d8db0cec1a4aa04741f5fde411fc3d120e4e647cf9a46c89adfc69", "ja": "{$P$}さん、今のって……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，刚才那是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "5db0f2d7eecfa837792dcf6e595ceefd9586d9ac703634f03bfe3ea75fad7f7f", "ja": "今のが爽やかイケメン王子soumaくんの本性？　\nこれは……これは……、大スクープの予感……！", "zh": "刚才那就是清爽帅气王子souma的真面目？  \n这、这是……感觉要有大独家新闻了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1041_p", "source_sha256": "1f905f49b72d864b547430c141a29278c071184f6ee4b7217a62fbf4b15e9543", "ja": "茜、念のため言っておくけど……。", "zh": "茜，先说好啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1042_023aka", "source_sha256": "f1468277cc7c51b54024827f86598d2ec5aa4c4ad2322ad181679e33b269a243", "ja": "や、やだなぁ{$P$}ちゃん、\nもちろんわかってるよ！　誰にも言わないってば～。", "zh": "讨厌啦{$P$}，\n我当然明白啦！都说了不会告诉任何人的嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1043_023aka", "source_sha256": "95b12d8d2ceca35a8d09791595509ebbc8defef3637e947b1f4c1b02862d6eab", "ja": "ただ、ただね？　なんていうか、ムズムズして……\nうにゃー！　王様の耳はロバの耳ー！", "zh": "只是，只是嘛？怎么说呢，心里痒痒的……\n呜喵——！国王的耳朵是驴耳朵——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1044_010azu", "source_sha256": "a693d599042829d34603de77eddf56f5cede796292e2028ac9dc853ba8eca784", "ja": "ごめんね育ちゃん、茜ちゃん。遅くなっちゃうと\nいけないから、とにかく帰りましょう。", "zh": "对不起，小育，小茜。再晚就不好了，我们赶紧回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1046_p", "source_sha256": "c1767dc32ead80993f34f2f65d9e51c1fc72bc5c102e1fef15e9ddb924d12c00", "ja": "……すみません、送るのが最後になってしまって。\nちょっと遅くなってしまいましたね。", "zh": "……抱歉，最后才送你回去。\n时间有点晚了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1047_010azu", "source_sha256": "2043b67396f6a37a5d7dd46f79b77a22ed760797e89814abd416ff745642b216", "ja": "育ちゃんと茜ちゃんが先で当然ですから。\nふたりとも、あまり遅くならずに済んでよかったです。", "zh": "育和小茜先走也是理所当然的。还好你们两个都没太晚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1049_010azu", "source_sha256": "f07d88c68c6fc47e9236a48beb9fdc9e0fdd2cc127f0484bed64f1aa548ebf29", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}さん。\nお手間を取らせてしまって。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生。\n给您添麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1050_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1051_010azu", "source_sha256": "f99e49700e2b844df021905a303f3d687de1cdc4d13f311c02e207f2ae519da9", "ja": "駄目ですね、私、もっとちゃんとしないと。最初、\n何を言われてるかわからなかったんです。もう～っ。", "zh": "不行呢，我得更加好好振作才行。刚开始我都没明白别人在说什么。真是的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1052_010azu", "source_sha256": "1cd888b708aa20884c6c5357952ec69733c0b0873c1187c975ec09c1d398514e", "ja": "育ちゃんと茜ちゃんにも悪いことしちゃいました。\n明日、ちゃんと謝らないと。", "zh": "我也做了对不起育和小茜的事。明天一定要好好道歉才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1053_p", "source_sha256": "e160dc71513a8a48afa73db49323c2a33a03de520f80c5c549f16744861ccd67", "ja": "……あずささん。\nひょっとして、怒ってますか？", "zh": "……梓小姐。\n难道说，您生气了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1054_010azu", "source_sha256": "2972a438b4d9c8382973a404d44d21203c5b5c16fc53b2be47932a107b728e32", "ja": "え？　あ……。\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "咦？啊……{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1055_p", "source_sha256": "cb68d30df0a179448b27c33bcca58e949671bb48117e78d825921e64704c5b9a", "ja": "すみません、変な仕事を持ってきてしまって。大きな\n案件だと浮かれてしまって……リサーチ不足でした。", "zh": "抱歉，我带来了奇怪的工作。因为是大项目就得意忘形了……是我调查得不够。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1056_010azu", "source_sha256": "0f8f023350bc32ad7c9d744acaee3325123af69b1db98562ea5f71ed1caf6c3e", "ja": "それは違います。", "zh": "那不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1057_p", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1058_010azu", "source_sha256": "e15c3c3222f12819a97d08c9360e74c25a76d1eb80cf2e7dc13db36e831c76d0", "ja": "{$P$}さんのせいじゃありません。\n{$P$}さんは私のために……。", "zh": "不是{$P$}先生的错。\n{$P$}先生都是为了我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1059_010azu", "source_sha256": "8376bbaf3810922a288570addbfddc9b058cbe38632152cbf768abba3d264e7a", "ja": "私が見過ごせないのは、私の……\n私の今までの仕事を、あんな風に言われたからです。", "zh": "我无法视而不见，是因为我的……\n是因为我迄今为止的工作，被那样说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1060_010azu", "source_sha256": "ce2446e3e5a3ed983210cab5abb4573e2ac3e49117e3a068604eafd722f9c567", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、\n私のために選んでくれた仕事なのに。", "zh": "明明是{$P$}先生\n为我精心挑选的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1061_p", "source_sha256": "7f64bd44f91324edbf5bfeb142d8dc3ce2c67eafd04aaf128f656c66d91b35fe", "ja": "あずささん……。", "zh": "梓小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1062_010azu", "source_sha256": "96cade2b4307403a80aa14c16ab1cd90f2b3e32b946bb8a2ecb6aa95608b3212", "ja": "どれも胸を張れる立派な仕事です。\nなのに、あんな言い方……。", "zh": "每一份都是值得骄傲的出色工作。\n可你却说成那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1063_p", "source_sha256": "a4e1b8d553ffe505508607872fd5d691375e4e8808d881e95632f7941c70d713", "ja": "ただ今回ばかりはバラシになると思います。\n監督にも気に入ってもらえたのに、残念ですが……。", "zh": "不过，这次恐怕要告吹了。明明还得到了导演的赏识，真是遗憾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1064_010azu", "source_sha256": "95045a8f4468915599e9dea7a90d9a5472e9f3699456fb0551cd9d48f5f82d45", "ja": "構いません。", "zh": "没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1065_010azu", "source_sha256": "3c4a87d000417c7dfffec815c2d357870aad91c9ab1af6023a18613e28a7a820", "ja": "私は、アイドルです。\nアイドルとしての仕事がありますから。", "zh": "我是偶像。\n毕竟，我还有偶像的工作要做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1066_p", "source_sha256": "557ceab636b6d050a79daaecc0595b99fbb073c616e4867b605f5a0106053f36", "ja": "（アイドルとしての仕事……そうだ。\n今度のあずささんの公演は……）", "zh": "（偶像的工作……对了。\n接下来梓小姐的公演是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1067_006mak", "source_sha256": "265ac3cff39f884653e5ff98a9040e16dd96c45ad1f5747ebb35306db7cbb248", "ja": "はぁ～、そんなことがあったんですか。", "zh": "哈啊～原来发生过那种事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1068_038chz", "source_sha256": "27eaa40790a3210b0bb6fd57792dec6221d4bd3d04c9539726dd5456944491f5", "ja": "なんて人ですの！？　表では誠実なフリをしておいて、\n裏では、裏では、なんて破廉恥な……！", "zh": "究竟是什么人啊！？表面上装出一副正经的样子，背地里、背地里居然做出这么不知羞耻的事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_154_1069_006mak", "source_sha256": "28a070d3a30c61c5575323e2cc7bbbc168d239ceefb4c80403a7feb82abdb036", "ja": "最っ低ですよね！\nあずささんの魅力は他にもたくさんあるのに。", "zh": "真的太差劲了！\n明明あずさ还有那么多其他的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
